7832342_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JM7mRi9iJPoQ7kNvwF8UG2P&_nc_oc=AdqmsIqdqFN7HoyVRXXK78JIwtnaWnfKs1Q8Bp9ULokRdjCjSCExrYLQu6QWQTVbGqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXs7Z8HibzQuKbfCe5xMZWgN5_Z-kfihCMJ4a4jTlrNCg&oe=6B104D4E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Sd_meta_thumb.png", "id": "1848539072526913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821716_1848539075860246_6378055504840272013_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ipgwo6M2QfgQ7kNvwEP3ES6&_nc_oc=AdopyvnvU71AoX0pTFI5Pp1EsRD0Mr7XWTWJS6UZcgYyLem4X8EFtTUaQQD8u5phCFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWBFQp6dtBMGzXdLsdY-9q0MiP1koyEM0i7_ZyRBSXydg&oe=6B10403B"}, "display_name": "Dark Ride: Sweet Dreams", "keywords": ["ThemePark", "Theme", "Park", "Cozy", "Cute"], "long_description": "Dark Ride: Sweet Dreams is a theme park\u2013style dark ride cozy VR experience. An indoor attraction where visitors travel through themed scenes that tell a story using immersive environments, sound, lighting, and special effects. In this version, virtual reality enhances the experience, fully surrounding riders in a dream world.\n\nThis ride is only a small part of a much larger theme park built around deeper lore and hidden mysteries. \n\nEARLY ACCESS\n\nDark Ride: Sweet Dreams is currently in active development.\nThis version includes the core ride experience, but additional scenes, features, and polish are planned for future updates.", "short_description": "Dark Ride: Sweet Dreams is a cozy VR dark ride."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://presskit.paleozoic.com/privacy-policy-sweet-dreams.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Paleozoic", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/HjhwQr5gdU", "website_url": "https://paleozoic.com/", "category": null, "comfort_ratin